# Always Use Curly Braces for Control Flow

**Never** write one-liner `if`, `else`, `for`, or `while` statements.
Always use curly braces, even for a single statement body.

Applies to `if`/`else if`/`else`, `for`, `for...of`, `for...in`, `while`, and `do...while`.

Good:

```ts
if (!enabled) {
  return;
}
```

Bad:

```ts
if (!enabled) return;
```

```ts
if (!enabled)
  return;
```

Apply this to all new and edited code in this repo.
